<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Comparison of SOF and SPD metrics for political tweet summarisation. Green bars represent the oracle prompt by including actual frequency information. Blue bars are the base frameworks and orange bars are the REFER counterparts associated with them. When a REFER framework is statistically significantly better (lower value) than its base framework, the pair is highlighted using a green star on top. If a base framework is better, then it is highlighted using a red star.</figcaption>
</figure>
